{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/797837-looking-for-a-pbp-v-tm","id":797837,"title":"Looking for a PbP V:tM","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-01T08:53:06-08:00","id":797837,"title":"Looking for a PbP V:tM","content":"As the title suggest I am looking for a PbP game set in Vampire the Masquerade. Mostly a Cam or Anarch game. Because of School and Work I am finding it difficult to arrange a in person Table top and while there is a LARP in Pittsburgh which is not too terribly far school and work have made my time limited for that kind of play. But I am very eager to play.<br /> <br /> If anyone is setting up a game, or perhaps has a game going I would love to get involved.<br /> I was thinking of using a Tzimisce who uses his disciplines to help support the Masquerade by altering vampires, ghouls, and corpses to help cover up the existence of vampires.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10579-perpetr8r","name":"Perpetr8r","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"75"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-03T05:34:30-08:00","id":799551,"title":"","content":"Hi, have you already visited my forum? If not take a look here: <a href=\"http://s15.zetaboards.com/Silence_and_Whispers/index/\" target=\"_blank\">http://s15.zetaboards.com/Silence_and_Whispers/index/</a><br /> It's not technically a &quot;Cam or Anarch&quot; game since the Domain isn't under the control of any sect, but it's not a Sabbat game if that was what you wanted to avoid, and we have no objection against Tzim Antitribu if that's what you have in mind! Could it work?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://silenceandwhispers.icyboards.net/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i65.tinypic.com/jpbv9t.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3552-featherstone","name":"featherstone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"287"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-03T08:03:47-08:00","id":799615,"title":"","content":"I saw the name before but I was on my mobile and then could not find the post I was originally on when I found it. The site looks very interesting.<br /> I am curious, I have read the Character Submission Guide, I notice a distinct lack of Flaws and Merits, is that intentional?<br /> <br /> Also I really do like the idea of the Tzimisce character but I am not stuck on that Idea. What clan or bloodline is under represented? Any oddballs need more support? Especially with DAV20 out I know some bloodlines got more support so people would want to play them, (Niktuku, Nagaraja, etc)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":10579,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10579-perpetr8r","user":"Perpetr8r","date":". 01-03-2016, 12:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10579-perpetr8r","name":"Perpetr8r","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"75"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-03T12:17:35-08:00","id":799731,"title":"","content":"Hi again! Merits and Flaws are entirely optional and you can pick them from whatever manual or list you can find on the internet... Otherwise, they are a part of the sheet and don't require any special explanation. The only thing to say about them is that Iron Will, Unbondable and Red List are highly restricted (read: don't take them) and that, just like any other stat or trait you can have, they should be reflected and justified in your story. <br /> <br /> As for clans and bloodlines, go for what you like, really. You can take a look to the list of approved characters if you want to see what we have around, but the Domain isn't supposed to represent the normal distribution of clans anyway. Some thing to consider is that you don't have a Prince or Baron to give you missions, and that the game (as most play by forum games) is more focused on RP, mystery and interaction than heavy PvP, so you may want to keep that in mind while thinking to a character that would work well with the setting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://silenceandwhispers.icyboards.net/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i65.tinypic.com/jpbv9t.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3552-featherstone","name":"featherstone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"287"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-03T12:20:19-08:00","id":799732,"title":"","content":"That won't be an issue. I do not play PvP in virtually any games I play.<br /> <br /> At work now but I will think through some ideas ty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"http